{"availability":"available","full":"imMamdouhaboammar/agent-skill-observatory","name":"agent-skill-observatory","description":"Evidence-based discovery, specification validation, static security auditing, and ranking for open Agent Skills across Claude Code, Codex, Antigravity, and Cursor.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-09T16:16:49Z","updated":"2026-10-10T14:27:27Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://imMamdouhaboammar.github.io/agent-skill-observatory/","topics":["agent-skills","ai-agents","antigravity","claude-code","codex","cursor","llms-txt","observatory","security-auditing","skills-sh"],"demo":"https://immamdouhaboammar.github.io/agent-skill-observatory/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:27.663Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:27.663Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:27.663Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T15:06:27.663Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A production-grade discovery, specification validation, static security auditing, explainable scoring, and publishing platform for the open Agent Skills ecosystem.","It answers the critical questions for modern AI agent toolchains:","Which repositories contain actual, valid Agent Skills? What evidence supports each manifest? How closely does each skill adhere to open specifications? What static security or permission risks are present? How actively maintained is the repository, and why is the skill ranked where it is?"],"features":["Strict Manifest Grounding: Requires a real SKILL.md before a skill can be cataloged. No indexing empty or keyword-stuffed repos.","Comprehensive Spec Validation: Strictly validates Agent Skills specification parameters (name syntax, description length, allowed properties).","Explainable, Uncoupled Scoring: Keeps Quality (35%), Security (30%), Maintenance (20%), and Adoption (15%) distinct. Archived repos are capped below 50.","Multi-Agent Universal Standard (OmniSkill): Plug-and-play compatibility across Antigravity, Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, OpenCode, and Skills.sh.","Content Deduplication: Normalized SHA-256 fingerprinting clusters identical manifests across fork storms and re-uploads."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/imMamdouhaboammar/agent-skill-observatory/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6657185cffae62db521bd50ab67ccad866d93b197be31821447f7a5da09ca9ab","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:27.794Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:27.794Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A production-grade discovery, specification validation, static security auditing, explainable scoring, and publishing platform for the open Agent Skills ecosystem.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/imMamdouhaboammar/agent-skill-observatory/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"6657185cffae62db521bd50ab67ccad866d93b197be31821447f7a5da09ca9ab","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/imMamdouhaboammar/agent-skill-observatory/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:27.794Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T14:27:27Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/imMamdouhaboammar/agent-skill-observatory/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:27.795Z","hash":"6657185cffae62db521bd50ab67ccad866d93b197be31821447f7a5da09ca9ab","originalBytes":13323,"storedBytes":13323,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["skill","security","skillobs","github","skills","agent","static","api","bash","data","catalog","score","local","validation","aggregate","directory","discovery","make","observatory","open","awesome.md","dashboard","database","json","pages","refresh","repositories","scoring","skill.md","spec","web","agent-skill-observatory","alembic","awesome","code","csv","directly","each","end","fastapi","get","license","maintenance","multi-agent","published","quality","repository","strict","subgraph","unive